{"seq":2,"slug":"saga-patterns","title":"Saga 编排模式：分布式事务的工程实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-microservices/patterns/saga-patterns","wordCount":1040,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"saga-编排模式-分布式事务的工程实现\">Saga 编排模式：分布式事务的工程实现</h1><p>在微服务架构中，跨服务的业务操作无法使用数据库事务保证原子性。一个电商下单流程可能涉及订单服务、库存服务、支付服务和配送服务——任何一步失败都需要补偿已完成的步骤。<strong>Saga 模式</strong>是处理这类分布式业务事务的标准解决方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"saga-的核心概念\">Saga 的核心概念</h2><p>Saga 将分布式事务分解为<strong>本地事务序列</strong>，每个本地事务：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>更新本地数据库（ACID 保证）</li>\n<li>发布消息/事件触发下一步</li>\n</ol>\n<p>如果某步失败，执行**补偿事务（Compensating Transactions）**撤销已完成的步骤。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[OrderService&lt;br/&gt;创建订单] --&gt;|OrderCreated| B[InventoryService&lt;br/&gt;预留库存]&#10;    B --&gt;|StockReserved| C[PaymentService&lt;br/&gt;处理支付]&#10;    C --&gt;|PaymentCompleted| D[ShippingService&lt;br/&gt;创建配送]&#10;    D --&gt;|ShipmentCreated| E[完成]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt;|失败| D2[取消配送]&#10;    C --&gt;|支付失败| C2[释放库存]&#10;    B --&gt;|库存不足| B2[取消订单]\">graph LR\n    A[OrderService&lt;br/&gt;创建订单] --&gt;|OrderCreated| B[InventoryService&lt;br/&gt;预留库存]\n    B --&gt;|StockReserved| C[PaymentService&lt;br/&gt;处理支付]\n    C --&gt;|PaymentCompleted| D[ShippingService&lt;br/&gt;创建配送]\n    D --&gt;|ShipmentCreated| E[完成]\n\n    D --&gt;|失败| D2[取消配送]\n    C --&gt;|支付失败| C2[释放库存]\n    B --&gt;|库存不足| B2[取消订单]</pre><h2 id=\"saga-的两种模式\">Saga 的两种模式</h2><h3 id=\"choreography-编排-编舞\">Choreography（编排/编舞）</h3><p>服务间通过事件直接协作，无中央协调者。每个服务监听事件并决定下一步操作：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Order as Order Service&#10;    participant Kafka&#10;    participant Inventory as Inventory Service&#10;    participant Payment as Payment Service&#10;&#10;    Order-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 发布 OrderCreated&#10;    Inventory-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 订阅 OrderCreated&#10;    Inventory-&gt;&gt;Inventory: 预留库存&#10;    Inventory-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 发布 StockReserved&#10;    Payment-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 订阅 StockReserved&#10;    Payment-&gt;&gt;Payment: 处理支付&#10;    Payment-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 发布 PaymentCompleted&#10;&#10;    Note over Inventory: 如果库存不足&#10;    Inventory-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 发布 StockReservationFailed&#10;    Order-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 订阅 StockReservationFailed&#10;    Order-&gt;&gt;Order: 取消订单\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Order as Order Service\n    participant Kafka\n    participant Inventory as Inventory Service\n    participant Payment as Payment Service\n\n    Order-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 发布 OrderCreated\n    Inventory-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 订阅 OrderCreated\n    Inventory-&gt;&gt;Inventory: 预留库存\n    Inventory-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 发布 StockReserved\n    Payment-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 订阅 StockReserved\n    Payment-&gt;&gt;Payment: 处理支付\n    Payment-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 发布 PaymentCompleted\n\n    Note over Inventory: 如果库存不足\n    Inventory-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 发布 StockReservationFailed\n    Order-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 订阅 StockReservationFailed\n    Order-&gt;&gt;Order: 取消订单</pre><p><strong>Choreography 示例代码（Kafka）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Inventory Service 消费 OrderCreated 事件&#10;@KafkaListener(topics = &quot;order-events&quot;, groupId = &quot;inventory-service&quot;)&#10;public void handleOrderCreated(ConsumerRecord&lt;String, String&gt; record) {&#10;    OrderCreatedEvent event = deserialize(record.value());&#10;&#10;    try {&#10;        inventoryRepository.reserveStock(event.getOrderId(), event.getItems());&#10;&#10;        // 成功：发布 StockReserved 事件&#10;        eventPublisher.publish(&quot;inventory-events&quot;, event.getOrderId(),&#10;            new StockReservedEvent(event.getOrderId(), event.getItems()));&#10;    } catch (InsufficientStockException e) {&#10;        // 失败：发布补偿事件&#10;        eventPublisher.publish(&quot;inventory-events&quot;, event.getOrderId(),&#10;            new StockReservationFailedEvent(event.getOrderId(), e.getProductId(), e.getMessage()));&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Order Service 消费补偿事件&#10;@KafkaListener(topics = &quot;inventory-events&quot;, groupId = &quot;order-service-saga&quot;)&#10;public void handleStockReservationFailed(ConsumerRecord&lt;String, String&gt; record) {&#10;    StockReservationFailedEvent event = deserialize(record.value());&#10;    orderService.cancelOrder(event.getOrderId(), &quot;INSUFFICIENT_STOCK&quot;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Inventory Service 消费 OrderCreated 事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">KafkaListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">topics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"order-events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">groupId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"inventory-service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleOrderCreated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ConsumerRecord</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">String, String</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> record) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    OrderCreatedEvent event </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deserialize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(record.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        inventoryRepository.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reserveStock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getOrderId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getItems</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 成功：发布 StockReserved 事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        eventPublisher.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"inventory-events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getOrderId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StockReservedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getOrderId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getItems</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (InsufficientStockException </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 失败：发布补偿事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        eventPublisher.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"inventory-events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getOrderId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StockReservationFailedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getOrderId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), e.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getProductId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), e.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Order Service 消费补偿事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">KafkaListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">topics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"inventory-events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">groupId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"order-service-saga\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleStockReservationFailed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ConsumerRecord</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">String, String</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> record) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    StockReservationFailedEvent event </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deserialize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(record.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    orderService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cancelOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getOrderId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INSUFFICIENT_STOCK\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Choreography 适用场景：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>简单的线性流程（步骤少，分支少）</li>\n<li>服务间松耦合优先</li>\n<li>团队规模小，沟通成本低</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Choreography 的局限：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>业务流程分散在各服务中，难以理解全局流程</li>\n<li>循环依赖风险（A 监听 B，B 监听 A）</li>\n<li>难以处理复杂的条件分支和并行步骤</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"orchestration-编排-协调\">Orchestration（编排/协调）</h3><p>引入中央协调者（Orchestrator）管理整个 Saga 流程，服务只执行操作并返回结果：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Orch as Saga Orchestrator&#10;    participant Order as Order Service&#10;    participant Inventory as Inventory Service&#10;    participant Payment as Payment Service&#10;&#10;    Order-&gt;&gt;Orch: 触发 CreateOrderSaga&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Inventory: 命令: ReserveStock&#10;    Inventory--&gt;&gt;Orch: StockReserved&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Payment: 命令: ProcessPayment&#10;    Payment--&gt;&gt;Orch: PaymentCompleted&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Order: 命令: ConfirmOrder&#10;    Order--&gt;&gt;Orch: OrderConfirmed&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Orch: Saga 完成&#10;&#10;    Note over Payment: 如果支付失败&#10;    Payment--&gt;&gt;Orch: PaymentFailed&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Inventory: 补偿命令: ReleaseStock&#10;    Inventory--&gt;&gt;Orch: StockReleased&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Order: 补偿命令: CancelOrder&#10;    Order--&gt;&gt;Orch: OrderCancelled\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Orch as Saga Orchestrator\n    participant Order as Order Service\n    participant Inventory as Inventory Service\n    participant Payment as Payment Service\n\n    Order-&gt;&gt;Orch: 触发 CreateOrderSaga\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Inventory: 命令: ReserveStock\n    Inventory--&gt;&gt;Orch: StockReserved\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Payment: 命令: ProcessPayment\n    Payment--&gt;&gt;Orch: PaymentCompleted\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Order: 命令: ConfirmOrder\n    Order--&gt;&gt;Orch: OrderConfirmed\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Orch: Saga 完成\n\n    Note over Payment: 如果支付失败\n    Payment--&gt;&gt;Orch: PaymentFailed\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Inventory: 补偿命令: ReleaseStock\n    Inventory--&gt;&gt;Orch: StockReleased\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Order: 补偿命令: CancelOrder\n    Order--&gt;&gt;Orch: OrderCancelled</pre><h2 id=\"temporal-工作流引擎实现-saga\">Temporal：工作流引擎实现 Saga</h2><p><strong>Temporal</strong> 是专为长运行业务流程设计的开源工作流引擎，它通过<strong>持久化执行历史</strong>解决了分布式 Saga 的核心难题：工作流代码崩溃后可以从断点恢复。</p>\n<h3 id=\"temporal-的核心概念\">Temporal 的核心概念</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Workflow</strong></td>\n<td>业务流程定义，持久化执行，可跨越故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Activity</strong></td>\n<td>实际执行操作的函数，有独立重试策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Task Queue</strong></td>\n<td>Worker 从中拉取任务的队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Worker</strong></td>\n<td>执行 Workflow 和 Activity 的进程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"temporal-saga-实现示例-go\">Temporal Saga 实现示例（Go）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Workflow 定义：CreateOrderWorkflow&#10;func CreateOrderWorkflow(ctx workflow.Context, order Order) error {&#10;    ao := workflow.ActivityOptions{&#10;        StartToCloseTimeout: 30 * time.Second,&#10;        RetryPolicy: &amp;temporal.RetryPolicy{&#10;            MaximumAttempts: 3,&#10;        },&#10;    }&#10;    ctx = workflow.WithActivityOptions(ctx, ao)&#10;&#10;    // Step 1: 预留库存&#10;    var reservationID string&#10;    err := workflow.ExecuteActivity(ctx, ReserveStockActivity, order).Get(ctx, &amp;reservationID)&#10;    if err != nil {&#10;        return fmt.Errorf(&quot;reserve stock failed: %w&quot;, err)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // Step 2: 处理支付（失败时补偿）&#10;    var paymentID string&#10;    err = workflow.ExecuteActivity(ctx, ProcessPaymentActivity, order).Get(ctx, &amp;paymentID)&#10;    if err != nil {&#10;        // 补偿：释放库存&#10;        releaseErr := workflow.ExecuteActivity(ctx, ReleaseStockActivity, reservationID).Get(ctx, nil)&#10;        if releaseErr != nil {&#10;            // 补偿失败：记录警报，需人工介入&#10;            workflow.ExecuteActivity(ctx, AlertManualInterventionActivity, order.ID, releaseErr)&#10;        }&#10;        return fmt.Errorf(&quot;payment failed: %w&quot;, err)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // Step 3: 确认订单&#10;    err = workflow.ExecuteActivity(ctx, ConfirmOrderActivity, order.ID, paymentID).Get(ctx, nil)&#10;    if err != nil {&#10;        // 补偿：退款 + 释放库存&#10;        workflow.ExecuteActivity(ctx, RefundPaymentActivity, paymentID)&#10;        workflow.ExecuteActivity(ctx, ReleaseStockActivity, reservationID)&#10;        return fmt.Errorf(&quot;order confirmation failed: %w&quot;, err)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    return nil&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Activity 实现：实际调用下游服务&#10;func ReserveStockActivity(ctx context.Context, order Order) (string, error) {&#10;    resp, err := inventoryClient.ReserveStock(ctx, &amp;inventory.ReserveRequest{&#10;        OrderID: order.ID,&#10;        Items:   order.Items,&#10;    })&#10;    if err != nil {&#10;        return &quot;&quot;, err  // Temporal 会根据 RetryPolicy 自动重试&#10;    }&#10;    return resp.ReservationID, nil&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Workflow 定义：CreateOrderWorkflow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CreateOrderWorkflow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> workflow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">order</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ao </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> workflow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ActivityOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        StartToCloseTimeout: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Second,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        RetryPolicy: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">temporal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RetryPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            MaximumAttempts: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8